#: ../../worker.md:2
msgid "Worker delegation"
msgstr "Worker 委派"

#: ../../worker.md:4
msgid ""
"A **worker** is a second minacode session running **in the same "
"process**. When the model recognizes a bounded task that deserves an "
"independent look — a review, a refactor, a second opinion — it hands the "
"task to the worker with the `Delegate` tool. The worker runs on its own "
"configured provider, with its own system prompt and a reduced tool set, "
"and keeps its context across delegations until you reset it. It never "
"calls back into the parent: every delegation is a serial detour whose "
"result comes back to the parent model."
msgstr ""
"**worker** 是运行在**同一进程内**的第二个 minacode "
"会话。当模型发现某个有边界的任务值得独立审视——审查、重构、第二意见——它会通过 `Delegate` 工具把任务交给 worker。worker"
" 运行在自己配置的 provider "
"上，使用自己的系统提示和精简的工具集，并在各次委派之间保留上下文，直到你重置它。它永远不会反向调用父级：每次委派都是一次串行绕行，其结果交还给父模型。"

#: ../../worker.md:11
msgid ""
"The design's main motivation is pairing models by cost: a large, capable "
"model orchestrates as the parent, while the worker — whose tasks are "
"bounded and spec'd — runs on a small, cheap one, so the tokens a "
"delegation burns cost a fraction of the parent's rate."
msgstr "这一设计的主要初衷是按成本搭配模型：一个大而强的模型作为父级负责编排，而任务有界、有 spec 的 worker 跑在一个小而便宜的模型上——一次委派所烧的 token 只相当于父级费率的一小部分。"

#: ../../worker.md:15
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../worker.md:17
msgid ""
"The parent orchestrates, so it usually runs the larger model; the worker "
"runs bounded tasks, so a faster, cheaper entry is enough for it — ideally"
" from a **different vendor** than `provider.active`, so its reviews "
"cross-validate the parent's. Point `[worker] provider` at that entry and "
"turn on `[runtime] worker`:"
msgstr ""
"父级负责编排，所以通常跑更大的模型；worker 跑有界任务，一个更快、更便宜的条目就"
"够用——最好与 `provider.active` 来自**不同厂商**，这样它的审查能与父级互相验证。把 "
"`[worker] provider` 指向该条目并打开 `[runtime] worker`："

#: ../../worker.md:47
msgid ""
"On the first run you will see the model call `Delegate` with an `order` "
"it wrote itself, you approve the send, and the worker takes over: a "
"yellow bracket opens in the terminal, its progress replaces the parent's "
"row in the status bar, and its final answer comes back to the parent "
"model, which decides what to do next. The worker also inherits the "
"session's language setting (`[runtime] language` or `/language`) on every"
" send."
msgstr ""
"首次运行你会看到模型调用 `Delegate`，携带它自己写的 `order`；你批准发送后 worker "
"接管：终端里出现一条黄色的分界规则，状态栏里它的进度取代父级那一行，最终答案交还给父模型，由它决定下一步。worker "
"还会在每次发送时继承会话的语言设置（`[runtime] language` 或 `/language`）。"

#: ../../worker.md:53
msgid ""
"`/worker` shows the worker's status, `/worker on` and `/worker off` "
"toggle delegation for the session, and `/worker reset` clears the "
"worker's context. `/worker provider NAME`, `/worker model MODEL`, "
"`/worker reason EFFORT`, and `/worker api API` re-target a live worker "
"immediately and future spawns, mirroring the parent's `/provider` "
"`/model` `/reason` `/api` switches; `default` clears an override back to "
"inheriting the provider entry. See [Commands](commands.md) for the full "
"syntax."
msgstr ""
"`/worker` 显示 worker 的状态，`/worker on` 和 `/worker off` 切换本次会话的委派，`/worker "
"reset` 清空 worker 的上下文。`/worker provider NAME`、`/worker model "
"MODEL`、`/worker reason EFFORT` 和 `/worker api API` 会立即重新定向当前存活的 worker "
"并影响之后的生成，对应父级的 `/provider` `/model` `/reason` `/api` 临时切换；`default` "
"清除覆盖，恢复继承 provider 条目。完整语法见[命令](commands.md)。"

#: ../../worker.md:60
msgid "What you see"
msgstr "你会看到什么"

#: ../../worker.md:62
msgid "The delegation bracket"
msgstr "委派分界规则"

#: ../../worker.md:64
msgid ""
"Two full-width rules bracket a delegation: a yellow `worker start` rule "
"with the worker's live provider and model plus the order's title (or "
"first line), the worker's streamed lines, then a yellow `worker done` "
"rule with the step count, elapsed time, tokens in and out, and the files "
"it touched."
msgstr ""
"两条全宽规则框住一次委派：一条黄色的 `worker start` 规则，带 worker 当前的 provider、模型和 order "
"标题（或首行）；接着是 worker 的流式输出行；最后是一条黄色的 `worker done` 规则，带步骤数、耗时、输入输出 token "
"数和它改动的文件。"

#: ../../worker.md:71
msgid "Status bar while delegating"
msgstr "委派期间的状态栏"

#: ../../worker.md:73
msgid ""
"While the worker runs, the status bar swaps the parent's row for the "
"worker's: a `[worker]` marker, then the worker's provider and model, its "
"reasoning effort, and its context fill with cache ratio."
msgstr ""
"worker 运行时，状态栏把父级那一行换成 worker 的：一个 `[worker]` 标记，然后是 worker 的 provider "
"与模型、它的推理力度，以及它的上下文占用与缓存比例。"

#: ../../worker.md:79
msgid "The send approval brief"
msgstr "发送审批简报"

#: ../../worker.md:81
msgid ""
"Every `Delegate send` asks for approval, even under `yolo` — the "
"confirmation prints the title, a one-line excerpt of the order, any "
"explicit `language` or `max_steps`, and the effective worker "
"provider/model/effort/api, with `(inherit)` marking a field that inherits"
" the provider entry's value. `c` opens a small loop that adjusts those "
"worker settings before you decide; a refused send feeds your reason back "
"to the model."
msgstr ""
"每次 `Delegate send` 都需要审批，即使在 `yolo` 下也一样——确认会打印标题、order 的单行摘录、任何显式的 "
"`language` 或 `max_steps`，以及生效的 worker "
"provider/model/effort/api，`(inherit)` 标记表示该字段继承 provider 条目的值。`c` "
"打开一个小循环，在决定前调整这些 worker 设置；被拒绝的发送会把你的理由反馈给模型。"

#: ../../worker.md:89
msgid "Semantics"
msgstr "语义"

#: ../../worker.md:91
msgid ""
"**Reset drops the conversation, not the work.** The worker owns only its "
"conversation; `/worker reset` (or a `Delegate reset` call) clears that "
"conversation — and the wrong beliefs it may have accumulated — on "
"purpose, while file changes and merged diffs always survive."
msgstr ""
"**重置丢弃的是对话，不是成果。** worker 只拥有它的对话；`/worker reset`（或一次 `Delegate reset` "
"调用）刻意清空这段对话——连同它可能积累的错误认知——而文件改动和已合并的 diff 始终保留。"

#: ../../worker.md:94
msgid ""
"**Snapshots belong to the parent.** A worker's session id is the parent's"
" with a `.w` suffix; worker snapshots are never listed in `/sessions`, "
"and when the parent's snapshot expires its orphaned workers expire with "
"it."
msgstr ""
"**快照从属于父级。** worker 的会话 id 是父级 id 加 `.w` 后缀；worker 快照永远不会出现在 `/sessions` "
"列表里，当父级快照过期时，孤儿的 worker 也随之一并过期。"

#: ../../worker.md:97
msgid ""
"**The tool block is frozen at session start.** The `Delegate` tool block "
"is fixed from `[worker] provider` when the session begins, protecting the"
" prompt-cache scope: changing the provider mid-session tunes an already-"
"enabled delegation, but enabling delegation from scratch (provider unset "
"at start) takes effect after a restart."
msgstr ""
"**工具块在会话开始时冻结。** `Delegate` 工具块在会话开始时由 `[worker] provider` 固定，以保护 prompt "
"缓存的作用域：运行中切换 provider 只会调优已启用的委派，而从头启用委派（开始时未设置 provider）需要重启后才会生效。"

#: ../../worker.md:101
msgid ""
"**Sends are confirmed even under `yolo`.** The order is a spec the model "
"wrote for itself, and the approval brief is the one cheap check on it — "
"every send asks."
msgstr "**即使在 `yolo` 下也会确认发送。** order 是模型为自己写的规格，审批简报是对它的唯一廉价检查——每次发送都会询问。"

#: ../../worker.md:103
msgid ""
"**The worker inherits your environment.** It shares the parent's cwd, "
"skills, MCP servers, and language setting; only files and the repository "
"truly belong to both."
msgstr "**worker 继承你的环境。** 它共享父级的 cwd、技能、MCP 服务器和语言设置；只有文件和仓库真正属于双方。"

